        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Scaling both diffusivities by 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2, and 4 moves lambda through 34.56, 48.88, 69.12, 97.75, and 138.24 µm. The factor-of-four step doubles lambda, as sqrt(D) requires. The equal-diffusion curve on the comparison figure stays negative." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
